$ whycant exec /srv/app-arm64

✗ alice (uid 1000) cannot exec /srv/app-arm64

  /                drwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✓ traverse
  /srv             drwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✓ traverse
  /srv/app-arm64   -rwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✗ exec   ← blocked here

Why
  /srv/app-arm64 is an aarch64 binary and this machine is x86_64, so execve fails with
  "Exec format error".

Fixes (safest first)
  1. Install the x86_64 build of this program.
